    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nEd Dempsey and Associates are delighted to present no. 18 Mounttown Villas to the rental market a fully refurbished and remodelled open plan own door three-bedroom duplex townhouse situated on the first and second floor of this popular development. \n\nExtending to an impressive 88 sq. m. of well-designed internal accommodation, this superb home offers bright, spacious living areas perfectly suited to modern lifestyles.\nThe hall level comprises an entrance hall with storage cabinet off, leading to a generous front-facing dining area. To the middle lies a stunning contemporary kitchen, centred around an exceptional 8-foot island, which seamlessly connects to a wonderful sitting room. From here, doors open onto a private, westerly-facing terrace — ideal for evening sun and outdoor entertaining. The effortless flow between these spaces makes this level particularly impressive. A stylish guest W/C completes the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a main bathroom. The principal bedroom is a standout feature, benefiting from a luxury-appointed en-suite shower room. Further enhancing this attractive home is one designated parking space.\n\nThe property's location is truly exceptional, within close proximity of Dun Laoghaire and offering access to a wide range of recreational and leisure amenities. You can enjoy the vibrant atmosphere and cultural offerings of this seaside town. Commuting is effortless with convenient access to public transportation, including the nearby DART station, which connects you to Dublin and beyond.\n\nExplore the delights of Monkstown Village, renowned for its trendy eateries, bars, and boutique shops, all just a stone's throw away. For your daily needs, Tesco in Honeypark is within easy walking distance, ensuring that grocery shopping and essential purchases are convenient and accessible.\n\nThere is a wonderful selection of Montessori, National and Secondary schools including Clonkeen Montessori, Clonkeen College, Monkstown Educate Together, Dalkey School Project, Loreto Foxrock and Newpark Comprehensive nearby. There is also a number of popular neighbourhood shops such as Tesco Park Pointe, Twomey's Super Value, FX Buckley Butchers and Grange Pharmacy within striking distance. Local sports clubs such as Cuala GAA, Blackrock Rugby Club and Mounttown Lawn Tennis club (LTC) along with De Vesci Tennis Club provide excellent facilities for both adults and children. \n\nA brief description does not do justice, inspection highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Three Bedroom Duplex Townhouse in a Quiet Setting</li><li> Well Presented Throughout</li><li> Own Door Property</li><li> G.F.C.H.</li><li> Double Glazed Windows</li><li> Substantial Living Space</li><li> Sunny Westerly Facing Private Terrace</li><li> Designated Parking</li><li> Close to Excellent Public Transport Links Including Dart and Bus</li><li> Convenient Location Within Close Proximity of Schools, Recreational Amenities and Facilities.</ul>"
